   773	            involved.add(gen_abs + 1)
   774	        # conjugators move the band; the support of tau = g sigma_i^2 g^{-1}
   775	        # is the image of {i,i+1} under the conjugator's permutation. For the
   776	        # leftover-strand computation we use the permutation of the whole
   777	        # fibre braid: identity, so leftover is the unique unmoved strand
   778	        # of the four pairs after conjugating. FLAG if conjugators present.
